title: Menu: "Collapse this folder" on a folder, its menu when collapsed, "Collapse every folder" and "Expand every folder"
folders: rust-small
forbid-log: WARN.*script

wait 3000
left none
right none
fit
wait 1000
menu 860 500
wait 500
ui click 960 521
wait 1200
mark folder-collapsed
wait 500
fit
wait 900
mark folder-collapsed-fit
wait 500
menu 200 500
wait 500
ui click 300 629
wait 1200
mark expanded-every
wait 500
fit
wait 900
menu 200 500
wait 500
ui click 300 602
wait 1200
mark collapsed-every
wait 500
fit
wait 900
mark collapsed-every-fit
wait 500
quit
